<title>USA: AMRE hires First Southwest as new advisor.</title>
<headline>AMRE hires First Southwest as new advisor.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMRE Inc said on Thursday it hired First Southwest Co as its financial advisor in raising additional working capital, replacing Bear Stearns Cos Inc.</p>
<p>Bear Stearns had advised the company of a potential conflict of interest, AMRE said.</p>
<p>AMRE, the parent company of Century 21 Home Improvements Inc, said on November 15 it had hired Bear Stearns as an advisor and was discussing possible financing strategies with several groups including HFS Inc.</p>
</text>
